{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788203107152,"sessionID":"ses_fa6cfe050ffe51wxe0DFh4LAA3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_55f9294f789f4941abce5cdc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"./venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nimport csv, unicodedata, re\nfrom collections import Counter, defaultdict\n\nUFS = {\"AC\",\"AL\",\"AP\",\"AM\",\"BA\",\"CE\",\"DF\",\"ES\",\"GO\",\"MA\",\"MT\",\"MS\",\"MG\",\"PA\",\"PB\",\"PR\",\"PE\",\"PI\",\"RJ\",\"RN\",\"RS\",\"RO\",\"RR\",\"SC\",\"SP\",\"SE\",\"TO\"}\nNOISE = {\"fc\",\"ec\",\"ac\",\"sc\",\"clube\",\"club\",\"do\",\"da\",\"de\",\"dos\",\"das\",\"e\",\"esporte\"}\nALIAS = {\n    \"atletico mineiro\": \"atletico-mg\", \"atletico goianiense\": \"atletico-go\",\n    \"atletico paranaense\": \"atletico-pr\", \"athletico paranaense\": \"atletico-pr\",\n    \"sport recife\": \"sport\", \"cs alagoano\": \"csa\", \"ponte pretta\": \"ponte preta\",\n    \" america mineiro\": \"america-mg\", \"america fc minas gerais\": \"america-mg\",\n    \"america fc natal\": \"america-rn\", \"america rn\": \"america-rn\", \"america mg\": \"america-mg\",\n}\n\ndef base_norm(t):\n    t = unicodedata.normalize(\"NFKD\", t).encode(\"ascii\",\"ignore\").decode().lower()\n    t = re.sub(r\"\\(.*?\\)\", \" \", t)\n    t = re.sub(r\"[^a-z0-9]+\", \" \", t).strip()\n    return t\n\ndef parse_tokens(t):\n    toks = base_norm(t).split()\n    uf = None\n    if len(toks) > 1 and toks[-1].upper() in UFS:\n        uf = toks[-1].upper(); toks = toks[:-1]\n    toks = [x for x in toks if x not in NOISE]\n    return \" \".join(toks), uf\n\n# Build registry from authoritative match files (bare, uf) pairs\nregistry = defaultdict(set)  # bare -> {uf}\ndef reg(name, uf=None):\n    bare, u = parse_tokens(name)\n    u = u or uf\n    if not bare: return\n    if u: registry[bare].add(u)\n    else: registry[bare].add(None)\n\nwith open(\"data/kaggle/Brasileirao_Matches.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for r in csv.DictReader(f):\n        reg(r[\"home_team\"], r[\"home_team_state\"]); reg(r[\"away_team\"], r[\"away_team_state\"])\nwith open(\"data/kaggle/novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for r in csv.DictReader(f):\n        reg(r[\"Equipe_mandante\"], r[\"Mandante_UF\"]); reg(r[\"Equipe_visitante\"], r[\"Visitante_UF\"])\nwith open(\"data/kaggle/Brazilian_Cup_Matches.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for r in csv.DictReader(f):\n        reg(r[\"home_team\"]); reg(r[\"away_team\"])\nwith open(\"data/kaggle/Libertadores_Matches.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for r in csv.DictReader(f):\n        reg(r[\"home_team\"]); reg(r[\"away_team\"])\n\nambiguous = {b: ufs for b, ufs in registry.items() if len(ufs - {None}) > 1}\nprint(\"ambiguous bares:\", sorted(ambiguous.items()))\nprint(\"registry size:\", len(registry))\nEOF"},"output":"ambiguous bares: [('america', {'RN', 'MG'}), ('atletico', {'ES', 'MG', 'GO', 'BA', 'AC', 'PR'}), ('bahia', {'BA', 'BH'}), ('botafogo', {None, 'PB', 'RJ'}), ('bragantino', {'PA', 'SP'}), ('comercial', {'PI', 'MS'}), ('flamengo', {None, 'RJ', 'PI'}), ('guarani', {None, 'CE', 'SP'}), ('internacional', {None, 'RS', 'SC'}), ('juventude', {'RS', 'MA'}), ('nautico', {'RR', 'PE'}), ('operario', {'MT', 'PR', 'MS'}), ('rio branco', {'AC', 'ES'}), ('santa cruz', {'RS', 'RN', 'PE'}), ('santos', {None, 'AP', 'SP'}), ('sao raimundo', {'RR', 'PA'}), ('vitoria', {'BA', 'ES'}), ('ypiranga', {'RS', 'AP'})]\nregistry size: 339\n","metadata":{"output":"ambiguous bares: [('america', {'RN', 'MG'}), ('atletico', {'ES', 'MG', 'GO', 'BA', 'AC', 'PR'}), ('bahia', {'BA', 'BH'}), ('botafogo', {None, 'PB', 'RJ'}), ('bragantino', {'PA', 'SP'}), ('comercial', {'PI', 'MS'}), ('flamengo', {None, 'RJ', 'PI'}), ('guarani', {None, 'CE', 'SP'}), ('internacional', {None, 'RS', 'SC'}), ('juventude', {'RS', 'MA'}), ('nautico', {'RR', 'PE'}), ('operario', {'MT', 'PR', 'MS'}), ('rio branco', {'AC', 'ES'}), ('santa cruz', {'RS', 'RN', 'PE'}), ('santos', {None, 'AP', 'SP'}), ('sao raimundo', {'RR', 'PA'}), ('vitoria', {'BA', 'ES'}), ('ypiranga', {'RS', 'AP'})]\nregistry size: 339\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"./venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nimport csv, unicodedata, re\nfrom collections import Counter, defaultdict\n\nUFS = {\"AC\",\"AL\",\"AP\",\"AM\",\"BA\",\"CE\",\"DF\",\"ES\",\"GO\",\"MA\",\"MT\",\"MS\",\"MG\",\"PA\",\"PB\",\"PR\",\"PE\",\"PI\",\"RJ\",\"RN\",\"RS\",\"RO\",\"RR\",\"SC\",\"SP\",\"SE\",\"TO\"}\nNOISE = {\"fc\",\"ec\",\"ac\",\"sc\",\"clube\",\"club\",\"do\",\"da\",\"de\",\"dos\",\"das\",\"e\",\"esporte\"}\nALIAS = {\n    \"atletico mineiro\": \"atletico-mg\", \"atletico goianiense\": \"atletico-go\",\n    \"atletico paranaense\": \"atletico-pr\", \"athletico paranaense\": \"atletico-pr\",\n    \"sport recife\": \"sport\", \"cs alagoano\": \"csa\", \"ponte pretta\": \"ponte preta\",\n    \" america mineiro\": \"america-mg\", \"america fc minas gerais\": \"america-mg\",\n    \"america fc natal\": \"america-rn\", \"america rn\": \"america-rn\", \"america mg\": \"america-mg\",\n}\n\ndef base_norm(t):\n    t = unicodedata.normalize(\"NFKD\", t).encode(\"ascii\",\"ignore\").decode().lower()\n    t = re.sub(r\"\\(.*?\\)\", \" \", t)\n    t = re.sub(r\"[^a-z0-9]+\", \" \", t).strip()\n    return t\n\ndef parse_tokens(t):\n    toks = base_norm(t).split()\n    uf = None\n    if len(toks) > 1 and toks[-1].upper() in UFS:\n        uf = toks[-1].upper(); toks = toks[:-1]\n    toks = [x for x in toks if x not in NOISE]\n    return \" \".join(toks), uf\n\n# Build registry from authoritative match files (bare, uf) pairs\nregistry = defaultdict(set)  # bare -> {uf}\ndef reg(name, uf=None):\n    bare, u = parse_tokens(name)\n    u = u or uf\n    if not bare: return\n    if u: registry[bare].add(u)\n    else: registry[bare].add(None)\n\nwith open(\"data/kaggle/Brasileirao_Matches.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for r in csv.DictReader(f):\n        reg(r[\"home_team\"], r[\"home_team_state\"]); reg(r[\"away_team\"], r[\"away_team_state\"])\nwith open(\"data/kaggle/novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for r in csv.DictReader(f):\n        reg(r[\"Equipe_mandante\"], r[\"Mandante_UF\"]); reg(r[\"Equipe_visitante\"], r[\"Visitante_UF\"])\nwith open(\"data/kaggle/Brazilian_Cup_Matches.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for r in csv.DictReader(f):\n        reg(r[\"home_team\"]); reg(r[\"away_team\"])\nwith open(\"data/kaggle/Libertadores_Matches.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    for r in csv.DictReader(f):\n        reg(r[\"home_team\"]); reg(r[\"away_team\"])\n\nambiguous = {b: ufs for b, ufs in registry.items() if len(ufs - {None}) > 1}\nprint(\"ambiguous bares:\", sorted(ambiguous.items()))\nprint(\"registry size:\", len(registry))\nEOF","time":{"start":1788203107148,"end":1788203107151}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"BR-Football uses mixed naming: \"America MG\" / \"America RN\", \"Botafogo RJ\" / \"Botafogo PB\" / \"Botafogo SP\", \"Fluminense RJ\" / \"Fluminense PI\", \"Vasco Da Gama RJ\", \"Atletico Mineiro\", \"Atletico Goianiense\", \"Atletico Paranaense\", \"Sport Recife\", \"EC Bahia\", \"EC Vitoria\", \"Fortaleza FC\"/\"Fortaleza EC\", \"Sao Paulo\", \"Corinthians\", \"Palmeiras\", \"Gremio\"/\"Gremio RS\", \"Internacional\"/\"Internacional RS\", \"CSA\", \"Avai\", \"Chapecoense\", \"Coritiba\"/\"Coritiba PR\"...\n\nNormalization strategy:\n1. lowercase + strip accents + remove parentheticals\n2. extract trailing UF token if last token in UFS (e.g. \"america mg\" → bare \"america\", uf MG) — handles \"America MG\", \"Botafogo RJ\", \"Fluminense PI\", \"Gremio RS\", \"Aguia Negra-MS\" (hyphen becomes space → \"aguia negra ms\").\n3. token cleanup: drop noise tokens {fc, ec, ac, sc, aa, ca, ad, se, ge, ce, pstc?} — careful \"CSA\" is a club (Centro Sportivo Alagoano)! \"CS Alagoano\" also in list — \"csa\" vs \"cs alagoano\". If I drop \"cs\" token from \"cs alagoano\" → \"alagoano\" ≠ \"csa\". Special-case alias \"cs alagoano\"→\"csa\". \"CA Parana\" → drop \"ca\" → \"parana\" (Clube Atlético Paranaense? no wait, \"CA Parana\" in Serie B/C context = \"CA Paranaense\"? Hmm \"CA Parana\" might be \"Clube Atlético Paranaense\"?? Actually there's \"Operario PR\", \"CA Parana\"... In Serie C there was \"CA Parana\" — this is likely \"Clube Atlético Paranaense\"?? No — Atlético Paranaense is Serie A. \"CA Parana\" — maybe it's short for something else. There's \"Maringa\", \"Metropolitano Maringa PR\"... I won't chase every Serie C club; focus on getting the main clubs right and reasonable behavior for the rest.\n\n4. Alias table (curated) mapping to canonical keys:\n   - \"atletico mineiro\" → \"atletico-mg\"\n   - \"atletico goianiense\" → \"atletico-go\"\n   - \"atletico paranaense\" → \"atletico-pr\" ; \"athletico paranaense\" → \"atletico-pr\"; \"ca parana\"? leave.\n   - \"sport recife\" → \"sport\"; \"sport club do recife\" → \"sport\"\n   - \"ec bahia\" → \"bahia\"; \"bahia de feira\" → separate club! \"Bahia de Feira\" is a different club (Bahia de Feira FC). Keep \"bahia de feira\" distinct — don't alias.\n   - \"ec vitoria\"/\"vitoria ec\" → \"vitoria\" (but \"Vitoria ES\"/\"Vitoria da Conquista\" are different clubs — they have UF tokens/extra words so bare key differs: \"vitoria es\" → bare \"vitoria\" uf ES!! That collides with EC Vitoria (BA) if I strip UF from \"Vitoria ES\"! Hmm: \"Vitoria ES\" = Esporte Clube Vitória? No — \"Vitoria ES\" is a club from Espírito Santo (Rio Branco ES? no...). There IS \"Vitoria ES\" — Vitória-ES? There's \"Esporte Clube Vitória\" from ES? Actually \"Vitoria ES\" in Serie D context: \"Vitória FC\" from Espírito Santo? hmm. And \"Vitoria da Conquista\" is Vitória da Conquista FC. And \"EC Vitoria\" is the big Bahia club.\n     This is the general UF-suffix ambiguity problem: stripping UFs creates collisions (\"Vitoria ES\" → \"vitoria\" vs \"EC Vitoria\" → \"vitoria\"). \n\nDecision: only strip UF when the resulting bare name matches a KNOWN major club from the authoritative sources (the three main files + novo have UF columns). For unknown collisions, keep distinct.\n\nSimpler robust approach — build the registry from authoritative sources:\n- From Brasileirao_Matches: names like \"Palmeiras-SP\" → (bare \"palmeiras\", uf SP). \n- From novo: \"São Paulo\" + Mandante_UF=SP → (\"sao paulo\", SP); \"Botafogo-RJ\" + UF=RJ.\n- From Brazilian_Cup/Libertadores: \"Palmeiras\" (no UF), \"América - MG\" (suffix in name).\n- Registry maps canonical_key → set of display names. canonical_key = bare if bare maps to single uf overall else bare-uf.\n\nThen for BR-Football names: \"America MG\" → tokens end with MG → candidate (america, MG) → look up registry: \"america\" ambiguous (MG, RN, CE?) → key \"america-mg\" exists → match! \"Fluminense PI\": registry has \"fluminense\" uf RJ → key \"fluminense\" (unambiguous) — but \"Fluminense PI\" is a DIFFERENT club (Fluminense-PI)! So stripping UF blindly wrong here. Since \"fluminense\" unambiguous in registry, \"Fluminense PI\" would map to key \"fluminense\" — WRONG.\n\nHmm. Fix: when a brf name has explicit UF that CONTRADICTS the registry UF for that bare name, treat as different club → key = bare-uf (\"fluminense-pi\"). When UF agrees or bare unknown → merge. That handles:\n- \"Gremio RS\" → (\"gremio\", RS) — registry gremio uf RS → key \"gremio\". \n- \"Fluminense PI\" → registry fluminense uf RJ ≠ PI → key \"fluminense-pi\". Distinct. \n- \"Botafogo RJ\" → registry botafogo ufs {RJ} (botafogo-pb/sp only in brf/cup?) → RJ matches → \"botafogo\". \"Botafogo PB\" → contradicts → \"botafogo-pb\". \n- \"America MG\" → registry america ufs {MG, RN} → ambiguous bare → key \"america-mg\" ✓. \"America RN\" → \"america-rn\" ✓.\n- \"Internacional RS\" → registry internacional uf RS → key \"internacional\" ✓.\n- \"Sao Jose RS\"/\"Sao Jose - POA\" → sao jose ambiguous → \"sao jose-rs\" ✓.\n- \"Vitoria ES\" → registry vitoria uf BA → contradiction → \"vitoria-es\" ✓ distinct from \"vitoria\". \"EC Vitoria\" → bare \"vitoria\" uf none → registry → \"vitoria\" (BA) ✓. \"Vitoria EC\" same ✓.\n\nRegistry UF sources: Brasileirao_Matches (explicit state columns + name suffix), novo (UF columns + name suffix), cup/libertadores (name suffix only when present). Note Libertadores has foreign teams: \"Barcelona-EQU\" — suffix EQU (Ecuador)! Not a Brazilian UF, so not stripped by UF set (EQU not in UFS). ✓. Cup names like \"Boavista Sport Club (antigo Esporte Clube Barreira) - RJ\" — parenthetical removed, suffix RJ ✓.\n\nFor FIFA clubs: alias table for Brazilian clubs:\n- \"atletico mineiro\" → \"atletico-mg\", \"atlético paranaense\"/\"athletico paranaense\" → \"atletico-pr\", \"america fc minas gerais\" → \"america-mg\", \"sport club do recife\" → \"sport\", \"ceara sporting club\" → \"ceara\", \"gremio\" → \"gremio\", \"parana\" → \"parana\" (Paraná Clube — matches \"Parana-PR\" in registry → key \"parana\"), \"chapecoense\" → \"chapecoense\", \"bahia\" → \"bahia\", \"vitoria\" → \"vitoria\", \"botafogo\" → \"botafogo\", \"fluminense\" → \"fluminense\", \"santos\" → \"santos\", \"internacional\" → \"internacional\", \"cruzeiro\" → \"cruzeiro\", \"corinthians\" → \"corinthians\", \"palmeiras\" → \"palmeiras\", \"sao paulo\" → \"sao paulo\", \"flamengo\" → \"flamengo\", \"vasco da gama\" → \"vasco da gama\", \"goias\" → \"goias\", \"fortaleza\" → \"fortaleza\", \"athletico paranaense\"...\n\nAfter noise-token removal (\"sport club\" → careful: \"Sport Club do Recife\" tokens [sport, club, do, recife]; removing \"club\"/\"do\" → \"sport recife\" — then alias \"sport recife\"→\"sport\"). I'll implement token-noise removal for {fc, ec, ac, sc, aa, ca?, clube, club, do, da, de, dos, das, esporte?} — wait \"Sport Club do Recife\": if I remove \"sport\"?? NO — never remove \"sport\" (Sport is a club name!). Remove only: fc, ec, ac, sc (careful: \"SC Coritiba\" → \"coritiba\" ✓ but... any club whose name IS \"sc\"? no), clube, club, do, da, de, e, \"esporte\"? \"Esporte Clube Bahia\" → \"bahia\" ✓ — but \"Esporte\" appears in... keep it simple: remove {fc, ec, ac, sc, clube, club, do, da, de, dos, das, do's}. Hmm \"Boa\" (\"Boa Esporte\"?) — \"Boa\" token stays. \n\nWait: removing \"ac\" — \"CRAC\" is one token (crac) not \"ac\". OK. Removing \"ca\" — \"CA Parana\" → \"parana\"; \"CA Taguatinga\" → \"taguatinga\"; \"CA Votuporanguense\" → \"votuporanguense\". Fine. But careful about clubs like \"AC\" alone? none. And \"AD Confianca\" → remove \"ad\" → \"confianca\" — and there's also \"Confianca\" separately ✓ merge. \"AE Altos\" → \"altos\" ✓ merges with \"Altos\". \"CE Aimore\" → \"aimore\" (CE = Club Athletico? Aimore). \"GE Bage\" → \"bage\". \"SE Gama\" → \"gama\" ✓. \"CS Sergipe\" → remove \"cs\"? \"CS Sergipe\" = Club Sport Sergipe → \"sergipe\" ✓. But \"CSA\" single token stays ✓. \"ASA AL\" → \"asa\" + uf AL ✓. \"ASA\" alone → \"asa\" ✓.\n\nEdge: \"Sao Jose - POA\" → \"sao jose poa\" → hmm \"POA\" = Porto Alegre, not UF. tokens [sao, jose, poa]; last token not UF → bare \"sao jose poa\". Registry has \"São José-RS\"? From cup/libertadores? Maybe. If registry lacks, stays distinct — acceptable. Actually \"Sao Jose - POA\" appears in Serie C? It's São José-RS (Porto Alegre). If \"sao jose rs\" exists in registry from elsewhere, key differs (\"sao jose poa\" vs \"sao jose-rs\"). Minor — Serie C clubs aren't the focus.\n\nEnough analysis — perfect entity resolution of 286 Serie C clubs is impossible without an exhaustive mapping; the spec's success criteria focus on major clubs (Flamengo, Palmeiras, Corinthians...) and team-name-variation handling for those. I'll:\n- Build registry with UF from authoritative files.\n- Canonicalize with UF-strip + contradiction rule + curated aliases (~40 major clubs).\n- Ambiguity reporting when a query resolves to multiple teams.\n\nNow the dedupe key for matches: (comp_key, season, home_key, away_key, round_label?) — brf has no round. Use (comp_key, season, date, home_key, away_key) as primary key and (comp_key, season, home_key, away_key) — no, pairs meet twice per season (home/away legs) → pair alone insufficient. Round: bra/novo have rounds; cup has round numbers; brf none; libertadores has stage.\n\nDedupe approach: primary key (comp, season, round, home_key, away_key) for files with round (bra, novo, cup); for brf (no round) and libertadores (stage instead of round): key (comp, season, date, home_key, away_key). Cross-file dedupe between bra and novo works via round key. Between brf and bra: brf matches keyed by date — do brf dates equal bra dates? Earlier raw check showed 0 overlap but that was without normalization. Let me test with proper keys: does (date, home_key, away_key) of brf 2019 Serie A overlap bra 2019? The brf sample: \"2019-12-08 Internacional Atletico Mineiro\" and bra probably has same fixture same date. Let me verify overlap after canonicalization prototype.\n\nAlso for standings: to be safe, I'll compute standings from a deduped league table; verify Flamengo 2019 = 90 pts and total matches = 380 per season in tests. If brf doesn't dedupe by date against bra, standings would double. Let me test.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0593602dd001oMP6jnhlrsWG3E","sessionID":"ses_fa6cfe050ffe51wxe0DFh4LAA3","messageID":"msg_059351fb100162JKZF103lJOBj"}}
