{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788203524764,"sessionID":"ses_fa6cfe050ffe51wxe0DFh4LAA3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_c7b15545c0ad4c54829fb1d4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"\"\"\"Brazilian Soccer MCP server package.\n\nProvides a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server exposing a queryable knowledge\nbase of Brazilian soccer data built from the Kaggle datasets in\n``data/kaggle/``: Brasileirão Serie A (2012-2022 and 2003-2019), Copa do\nBrasil, Copa Libertadores, extended match statistics, and the FIFA player\ndatabase.\n\"\"\"\n\n__version__ = \"1.0.0\"\n","filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-e6k_mc30/retort-9f7589d26ec0/brazilian_soccer_mcp/__init__.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-e6k_mc30/retort-9f7589d26ec0/brazilian_soccer_mcp/__init__.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"brazilian_soccer_mcp/__init__.py","time":{"start":1788203524756,"end":1788203524763}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"mcp 2.x: `MCPServer` from `mcp.server.mcpserver`, with `.tool()` decorator and `run_stdio_async()`. Memory streams: `create_client_server_memory_streams() -> AsyncGenerator[tuple[MessageStream, MessageStream]]` — returns (client_streams, server_streams) tuples.\n\nNow I have everything I need. Let me write the code files. Starting with the package.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0593c628f001DpRAY0I8K4TTdD","sessionID":"ses_fa6cfe050ffe51wxe0DFh4LAA3","messageID":"msg_0593c3e6b001Aikigm1OrbjhPB"}}
