e described\n    And the Copa Libertadores should span 2013 to 2022\n\n  Scenario: Historical seasons are covered by the 2003-2019 dataset\n    Given the match data is loaded\n    When I request the standings of \"Brasileirão Série A\" season 2005\n    Then the champion should be Corinthians\n","filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-e6k_mc30/retort-9f7589d26ec0/tests/features/competition_queries.feature"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-e6k_mc30/retort-9f7589d26ec0/tests/features/competition_queries.feature","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tests/features/competition_queries.feature","time":{"start":1788204226394,"end":1788204226399}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_0594717560014104WZiX0RVYtz","sessionID":"ses_fa6cfe050ffe51wxe0DFh4LAA3","messageID":"msg_05946f7a0001S2GNzeSH2jkfjD"}}
