r.club_key == club_res.key\n    else:\n        substring on player.club\n```\nresolve(\"Santos\") → \"santos-sp\" (known) → strict ✓ excludes Santos Laguna ✓. resolve(\"Liverpool\") → not found → substring ✓. resolve(\"Grêmio\") → \"gremio\" ✓ strict.\n\nHmm — but also \"Santos FC\"? resolve → frequency→ santos-sp probably. Fine.\n\n3. **test_display_prefers_plain_name** — flip display preference to simple-first.\n\nLet me also fix the sample_questions `answer()` unpacking bug, update check_relegated_2020 expectations after the display change (verify actual values after change), and check remaining BDD failures (match_queries ones — e.g. \"the dataset should contain 18 finals\": earlier smoke test gave cup finals total 18 ✓... let me see what failed there — probably also fine once I fix answer()). Actually match_queries failures were in the tail-30 listing? The listing showed FAILED test_player_queries, test_sample_questions, test_team_queries, test_normalize — I saw 34 failed. Let me fix known issues and rerun.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0594af1db001lb3rztXIxZbzgj","sessionID":"ses_fa6cfe050ffe51wxe0DFh4LAA3","messageID":"msg_0594ab2e2001ckjWNevFWsi37t"}}
